      "doc": "Runs one flash-loan-financed liquidation fill atomically. Only the\\nconfigured submitter may call. Returns realized profit in `loan_asset`\\nraw units. Same two-contract shape as `execute` (see that doc comment);\\nthe difference is WHAT runs inside exec_op: a full Blend liquidation\\n(pre-swaps -> submit_with_allowance -> post-swaps) instead of a swap chain.\\n`min_profit` is the final on-chain safety net \\xe2\\x80\\x94 a stale quote, moved\\nprice, or sandwich reverts the whole transaction here.",
